iones para asegurar una infraestructura escalable, segura y productivo.\\n* Optimización de rendimiento: Asegurar tiempos de carga rápidos, alta disponibilidad y una experiencia de usuario fluida y libre de errores.\\n* Mantenimiento y escalabilidad: Realizar tareas de mantenimiento preventivo y correctivo, así como de escalabilidad de las aplicaciones según las necesidades del negocio.", "resume_embedding": [-0.037038251757621765, 0.0024298853240907192, 0.04301130399107933, -0.048291053622961044, 0.009999528527259827, 0.027812020853161812, -0.03338509052991867, -0.017652500420808792, 0.009686209261417389, -0.03410505875945091, -0.007592975161969662, -0.004773108288645744, -0.027972012758255005, -0.026145432144403458, 0.013332704082131386, -0.0109128188341856, -0.026238761842250824, -0.03389173373579979, 0.04143804311752319, -0.02317224070429802, 0.07013002038002014, 0.003546499414369464, -0.030211906880140305, -0.06058380752801895, -0.08036953955888748, 0.03202515468001366, -0.03226514533162117, -0.024025533348321915, -0.017052529379725456, -0.16383226215839386, 0.00007244449807330966, -0.055784035474061966, 0.01759916916489601, -0.06223706156015396, -0.030238572508096695, -0.024478845298290253, 0.013999339193105698, 0.018465794622898102, -0.08863581717014313, -0.00047539424849674106, -0.026932062581181526, -0.022598933428525925, -0.05031762644648552, -0.04343795031309128, 0.026012105867266655, -0.07066333293914795, 0.0027415372896939516, 0.05333081632852554, -0.03583830967545509, 0.004969765432178974, -0.024998819455504417, 0.004773108288645744, -0.048851028084754944, 0.033171769231557846, -0.031358521431684494, -0.01227275375276804, 0.03397173061966896, -0.044984545558691025, 0.04629115015268326, 0.02370554767549038, 0.1038350984454155, 0.01701253093779087, -0.1816447675228119, 0.0174925085157156, -0.03551832213997841, -0.012932723388075829, -0.03165183961391449, 0.011919437907636166, -0.021785639226436615, 0.03866484388709068, 0.009532883763313293, -0.0507976040