0b3925fb-b39b-43f1-bb1f-2a1d5ee9ef1d	6c943346-9f93-4c83-82d4-a8b0045df548	FullStack Senior Developer con experiencia avanzada en desarrollo web	Desarrollo web	Ingeniería en Desarrollo de Software, Ingeniería en Sistemas Computacionales, Ingeniería en Software o afín	remoto	Azcapotzalco, CDMX	Buscamos un FullStack Senior Developer con experiencia avanzada en desarrollo web capaz de construir soluciones robustas tanto en el frontend como en el backend. El candidato ideal será una persona con gran conocimiento de tecnologías modernas, como AWS Lambda, Javascript (para Backend y Frontend), React, Vue.js, y con experiencia en la implementación de soluciones en la nube.\nSe espera que puedas liderar proyectos, trabajar bajo metodología ágil (Scrum) y tener experiencia trabajando con Google Analytics.\nResponsabilidades:\n* Desarrollo FullStack: Crear y mantener aplicaciones web de alto rendimiento utilizando tecnologías como JavaScript (Node.js para backend), React, Vue.js y Angular para frontend.\n* AWS y Lambda: Desarrollar, implementar y administrar funciones serverless utilizando AWS Lambda, optimizando los procesos y servicios que requieren escalabilidad y alta disponibilidad.\n* Integración con Google Analytics: Implementar y gestionar UTMs, eventos y configuración avanzada de Google Analytics para mejorar el seguimiento de métricas y el análisis de datos en las aplicaciones.\n* Metodología ágil (Scrum): Participar activamente en ciclos ágiles de desarrollo, colaborando con equipos multidisciplinarios en la planificación de sprints, revisiones y retrospectivas.\n* Desarrollo en la nube: Gestionar y optimizar soluciones cloud basadas en AWS, trabajando en colaboración con arquitectos de soluciones para asegurar una infraestructura escalable, segura y productivo.\n* Optimización de rendimiento: Asegurar tiempos de carga rápidos, alta disponibilidad y una experiencia de usuario fluida y libre de errores.\n* Mantenimiento y escalabilidad: Realizar tareas de mantenimiento preventivo y correctivo, así como de escalabilidad de las aplicaciones según las necesidades del negocio.	["AWS Lambda", "Javascript", "React", "Vue.js", "Node.js", "GoogleAnalytics", "Scrum", "Desarrollo en la nube", "Mantenimiento preventivo y correctivo."]	["Liderazgo", "Trabajo en Equipo", "Autonomía"]	[-0.019133292,-0.009659269,-0.040224902,-0.034376413,0.03988087,-0.021051913,-0.02406878,0.0056731664,-0.01729406,0.0045980765,0.006787952,-0.014343353,-0.02089313,-0.0018193829,0.04226261,-0.023711521,0.028422069,0.037631452,-0.05906709,-0.0040688016,0.02815743,-0.007118749,-0.040410146,-0.060654916,0.02138271,-0.0024660907,0.041151132,-0.032365166,-0.02201784,-0.13358901,-0.062295668,-0.056844138,0.027786938,-0.007217988,-0.02589478,0.015335743,0.08092615,-0.030300993,-0.03167711,0.029401226,0.007423082,0.014144874,-0.052980427,0.012689368,0.0084684,-0.094793156,-0.013079708,-0.0035626823,-0.10278521,0.039007567,0.00043127642,-0.05305982,-0.02152826,0.024015853,-0.019424392,0.06938795,-0.0007178292,0.046205707,0.0035428347,0.054091904,0.036625832,0.014105179,-0.13729393,0.0151901925,-0.008203763,0.08553084,-0.040833566,-0.060707845,-0.0529275,0.032920904,-0.018709872,0.017915959,0.0069665825,0.09934492,0.06536546,0.0012578551,-0.022308942,0.013919933,0.029189516,-0.006907039,0.0028845489,-0.010750898,-0.0030201755,0.043294694,0.022904376,-0.02017861,0.041098204,0.0036553056,0.039483916,0.010559036,-0.0035097548,-0.016473684,0.04220968,0.02385707,-0.033529572,0.023327796,-0.022877913,0.020059522,-0.016963264,0.39229864,-0.021581188,0.014952019,0.008243458,-0.03429702,0.021038681,-0.006136282,0.037234496,0.0049520293,-0.0071716765,0.05268933,-0.03514386,-0.022917608,0.003612302,0.010949377,-0.04692023,-0.015004947,-0.06690036,0.027363518,0.037710845,-0.004763475,-0.005395297,0.044908985,0.08113786,0.01643399,0.032206383,0.06637108,0.04226261,0.076903656,-0.015163729,0.053933125,0.042103827,0.042156756,-0.0017284137,-0.0026248733,0.025206722,0.033688355,-0.006592